    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'This completes the high level overview.


      You can connect to any other Unity Editor instances within your organization that are linked to this <b>Unity Project ID</b>, or create a project Build to connect with anyone!


      To further speed up your testing, you can use <a href="https://github.com/VeriorPies/ParrelSync/tree/master">ParrelSync</a>, a Unity Editor extension that allows you to test multiplayer gameplay without building the project. It opens another Unity Editor window and mirrors the changes from the original project.'
