    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The Sample Scene contains all the prefabs required to get started building a Mixed Reality Multiplayer Tabletop application:\L   \xB7  XRI Network Game Manager\L   \xB7  Network Manager (XR Multiplayer)\L   \xB7  MR Interaction Setup\n\n<b>Note:</b> <i>The <b>Device Simulator</b> is <b>enabled by default</b>. This will <b>prevent Quest Link from working</b>. Refer to the documentation to on how to disable the Device Simulator if you plan to use Quest Link</i>."
